  "description": "Ilea Spears wanted a fight, not a life behind a desk. So when this boxer-turned-med student wakes up in Elos -- a dangerous fantasy world where combat is a daily requirement -- she’s more than a little thrilled. There, she unlocks the long-lost Battle Healer class, an unusual blend of combat strength and healing magic, and discovers she may have finally found her calling. As she travels across the realms, leveling up faster than anyone expects, she begins to earn a reputation as something of a legend: the healer who isn’t afraid to punch back.\nSource: Webtoon",
